  "description": "BAVPOF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H77 Cl7 Gd6 N13 O29 1+,N1 O3 1-,4.5(C1 H4 O1),1.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.727-4.106 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.37-116.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd6(teaH)2(teaH2)2(CO3)(NO3)2(chp)7(H2O)](NO3)·4.5MeOH·1.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
